  "bodyHtml": "<br/>\n<blockquote class=\"callout callout_warn\" theme=\"⚠️\"><span class=\"callout-icon\">⚠️</span><h3 class=\"heading heading-3 header-scroll\"><div class=\"heading-anchor anchor waypoint\" id=\"updated-terminology\"></div><div class=\"heading-text\">Updated Terminology</div><a aria-label=\"Skip link to Updated Terminology\" class=\"heading-anchor-icon fa fa-regular fa-anchor\" href=\"#updated-terminology\"></a></h3><p>Settlements are now called Convert Currencies. These <code class=\"rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined\" data-lang=\"\">/send/crypto</code> endpoints handle cryptocurrency conversions and replace the legacy <code class=\"rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined\" data-lang=\"\">/settlements</code> endpoints. The functionality remains identical, only the terminology has changed. Legacy collections endpoints are deprecated but will continue to  work. We recommend migrating to these new <code class=\"rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined\" data-lang=\"\">/send/crypto</code> endpoints for future compatibility.</p></blockquote>"
